{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-interaction-design#card-zh","repo":"uckkk/dsh-interaction-design","commit":"ac159c3cdfc490c8c468877c14981262543774f8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"交互设计理论参考是一个面向 DSH 工具调用的中文交互设计知识插件。它在 DSH 的 tools 注入点注册两个工具，让用户可以列出十条常见交互设计理论，或按理论编号、中文名称和英文名称查询详细说明及示例。内容涵盖菲茨定律、希克定律、米勒定律、格式塔原理、尼尔森可用性原则、雅各布定律、多尔蒂阈值、峰终定律、美即好用效应和渐进式呈现。适合产品经理、设计师和开发者在讨论界面与交互方案时快速查阅概念。源码定义的是内置知识数据和本地工具查询逻辑，未列出额外密钥或服务配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:7-18","lib/index.js:20-64","cordis.patch.yml:2-4"]}
{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-interaction-design#card-en","repo":"uckkk/dsh-interaction-design","commit":"ac159c3cdfc490c8c468877c14981262543774f8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Interaction Design Theory Reference adds two DSH tools to list ten built-in theories or look up explanations and examples by ID or name. Topics include Fitts's Law, Gestalt, and Nielsen's heuristics. Designers can consult it while discussing interfaces; no extra service setup is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:7-18","lib/index.js:20-64","cordis.patch.yml:2-4"]}
